<title>USA: Elder-Beerman Stores Corp Q1 May 3 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Elder-Beerman Stores Corp Q1 May 3 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Elder-Beerman Stores Corp</p>
<p>				(unaudited)</p>
<p> For the 13 weeks ended:			   5/3/97    5/4/96</p>
<p>						   (dollars in thousands)</p>
<p> Total Sales - entire corporation		$ 119.8  $ 117.8</p>
<p> Comp Store Sales - Department Store division  112.2    108.1</p>
<p> Comp Store Sales - entire corporation	   119.3    115.7</p>
<p> EBITDA(R) (a)					     5.2	3.5</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)				     (3.3)    (2.9)</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation, amortization and restructuring costs.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
